---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro'
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Cintamani · Public proposals and criticism"
  description="Submit typed Cintamani siege proposals, criticism, scoped tests, and competing interpretations to a separate public review plane."
>
  <section class="public-hero" aria-labelledby="public-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Separate public D1 plane</p>
      <h1 id="public-title">Conjecture in public.<br /><em>Criticism by design.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        GitHub-authenticated contributions appear immediately as <strong>submitted · unreviewed</strong>.
        Administrative review never means true, likely, popular, or ranked—and this interface has no votes.
      </p>
      <div class="public-hero-actions">
        <a class="primary-action" data-content-submit href="/proposals/new/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Submit proposal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <a class="text-action" href="#public-list-title">Browse public proposals</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="public-boundary-copy" aria-label="Authority boundary">
      <p class="eyebrow">Authority boundary</p>
      <h2>What publication means</h2>
      <p>Public, attributable revision history with exact-revision criticism and scoped tests.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Registry and admission boundary</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>Separate from the canonical Rust/SQLite registry</li>
          <li>No direct Worker write into canonical admissions</li>
        </ul>
      </details>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <noscript>
    <p class="no-script-note section-shell">
      JavaScript is required for authenticated writes. The public record remains readable as
      <a href="/api/proposals">proposal JSON</a>; no account is required to read it.
    </p>
  </noscript>
  <p class="form-status section-shell public-plane-status" data-hub-status role="alert" hidden></p>

  <section class="section-shell public-hub-section public-hub-section--axes" aria-labelledby="overlay-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Siege-space overlay</p>
        <h2 id="overlay-title">Canonical axes</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Counts show unreviewed public member proposals beside canonical members; they do not merge the planes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="siege-overlay" data-siege-overlay aria-live="polite"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell public-hub-section public-proposals" aria-labelledby="public-list-title">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Public record</p>
        <h2 id="public-list-title">Proposals</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="proposal-filters" aria-label="Proposal filters">
        <label>Kind
          <select data-proposal-filter data-filter-kind>
            <option value="">All kinds</option>
            <option value="theoretical-model-member">Theoretical model</option>
            <option value="physical-material-member">Physical material</option>
            <option value="physical-calculation-mechanism-member">Physical mechanism</option>
            <option value="observation-interface-member">Observation interface</option>
            <option value="existing-member-assessment">Existing assessment</option>
            <option value="existing-member-correction">Explicit correction</option>
            <option value="ontology-change">Ontology change</option>
            <option value="explanatory-conjecture">Explanatory conjecture</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>Administrative state
          <select data-proposal-filter data-filter-state>
            <option value="">All states</option>
            <option value="submitted">Submitted</option>
            <option value="triaged">Triaged</option>
            <option value="under-review">Under review</option>
            <option value="selected-for-export">Selected for export</option>
            <option value="declined">Declined</option>
            <option value="withdrawn">Withdrawn</option>
            <option value="superseded">Superseded</option>
            <option value="admitted-link-recorded">Admission link recorded</option>
          </select>
        </label>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ul class="public-proposal-list" data-proposal-list aria-live="polite"></ul>
  </section>

  <section class="public-handoff-callout" aria-labelledby="handoff-title">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Maintainer boundary</p>
      <h2 id="handoff-title">Selection is not admission.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      A selected exact revision still requires independent verification, preview, and authorized promotion
      through the canonical domain admission workflow.
    </p>
  </section>

  <script>
    import { initializeProposalHub } from '../../scripts/proposal-hub.mjs'
    initializeProposalHub().catch((error) => {
      const status = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-hub-status]')
      if (status) {
        status.textContent = `Public proposal plane unavailable: ${error.message}`
        status.dataset.kind = 'error'
        status.hidden = false
      }
    })
  </script>
</SiteLayout>
